  "full_text": "The difference between a world run by kings and what we got today can be captured in the notion that the tax form that everybody uses is the 1040EZ. And the legal system is something more like the Ten Commandments than whatever, 462 laws or something. There's a queen in England but I don't see any evidence of that. Rich is good but that's been neglected. So the fat pigs are standing out everywhere to be slaughtered and replaced with royal grade collapsed replacements. So that's my genius that I acquired while creating my operating system. My scientific and computer programming discipline has given me the ability to work with flawless precision and logic. To date, I've been lazy, putting my thoughts into words and sloppy. I'm making effort to slow down and find the right way to say it. And you can tell a vast improvement.",
